# Google Sheet that mirrors the 1,000-day journey.
#
# Two distinct uses, two distinct kinds of URL:
#
#   1. "View Google Sheet" - a human-facing link. Any shareable sheet URL works.
#      When unset, those buttons render disabled.
#
#   2. Cloud sync - requires a WRITABLE Google Apps Script web-app endpoint
#      deployed as "Execute as: Me" with "Who has access: Anyone". Only this
#      shape can accept the app's POSTs:
#
#        https://script.google.com/macros/s/<DEPLOYMENT_ID>/exec
#
#      A `docs.google.com/spreadsheets/...` link is a view-only page. It opens
#      fine in a browser but rejects every POST, so the app detects it, skips
#      the request entirely, and runs in LOCAL MODE rather than showing a
#      permanent SYNC ERROR. Sync is therefore opt-in: leave this unset to run
#      entirely on local storage.
#
# Copy this file to `.env` and fill in the value.
VITE_GOOGLE_SHEET_URL=
